<title>USA: ValuJet executives sell stock.</title>
<headline>ValuJet executives sell stock.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ValuJet Inc said Thursday that its chairman and chief executive officer, Robert Priddy, and its president and chief operating officer, Lewis Jordan, have each sold one million shares of the company stock at a price of $8.25 per share.</p>
<p>ValuJet stock closed at 9-1/2 Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said the sale represents diversification of financial holdings for the two founders.</p>
